[{"category":"section","location":"api/#API-Reference","page":"API Reference","text":"This page documents all the types and functions in TreeTCI.jl.","title":"API Reference"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#TreeTCI.AbstractPivotCandidateProposer","page":"API Reference","text":"Abstract type for pivot candidate generation strategies\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.AbstractPivotCandidateProposer"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#TreeTCI.AbstractSweep2sitePathProposer","page":"API Reference","text":"Abstract type for pivot candidate generation strategies\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.AbstractSweep2sitePathProposer"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#TreeTCI.DefaultPivotCandidateProposer","page":"API Reference","text":"Default strategy that uses kronecker product and union with extra indices\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.DefaultPivotCandidateProposer"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#TreeTCI.DefaultSweep2sitePathProposer","page":"API Reference","text":"Default strategy\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.DefaultSweep2sitePathProposer"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#TreeTCI.LocalAdjacentSweep2sitePathProposer","page":"API Reference","text":"LocalAdjacent strategy\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.LocalAdjacentSweep2sitePathProposer"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#TreeTCI.RandomSweep2sitePathProposer","page":"API Reference","text":"Random strategy\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.RandomSweep2sitePathProposer"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#TreeTCI.SimplePivotCandidateProposer","page":"API Reference","text":"Simple strategy that uses kronecker product and union with extra indices\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.SimplePivotCandidateProposer"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#TreeTCI.SimpleTCI","page":"API Reference","text":"SimpleTCI{ValueType}\n\nTree tensor cross interpolation (TCI) for tree tensor networks.\n\nFields\n\nIJset::Dict{SubTreeVertex,Vector{MultiIndex}}: Pivots sets for each subtrees\nlocaldims::Vector{Int}: Local dimensions for each vertex tensor\ng::NamedGraph: Tree graph structure\nbonderrors::Dict{NamedEdge,Float64}: Error estimate per bond by 2-site sweep\npivoterrors::Vector{Float64}: Error estimate for backtruncation of bonds\nmaxsamplevalue::Float64: Maximum sample value for error normalization\nIJset_history::Vector{Dict{SubTreeVertex,Vector{MultiIndex}}}: History of pivots sets for each sweep\n\nExample\n\n# Create a simple tree graph\ng = NamedGraph([1, 2, 3])\nadd_edge!(g, 1 => 2)\nadd_edge!(g, 2 => 3)\n\n# Define local dimensions\nlocaldims = [2, 2, 2]\n\n# Create a SimpleTCI instance\ntci = SimpleTCI{Float64}(localdims, g)\n\n# Add initial pivots\naddglobalpivots!(tci, [[1,1,1], [2,1,1]])\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.SimpleTCI"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#TreeTCI.SimpleTCI-Union{Tuple{ValueType}, Tuple{F}, Tuple{F, Vector{Int64}, NamedGraphs.NamedGraph}, Tuple{F, Vector{Int64}, NamedGraphs.NamedGraph, Vector{Vector{Int64}}}} where {F, ValueType}","page":"API Reference","text":"Initialize a SimpleTCI instance with a function, local dimensions, and graph.  The initial grobal pivots are set to ones(Int, length(localdims)).\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.SimpleTCI"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#TreeTCI.TruncatedDefaultPivotCandidateProposer","page":"API Reference","text":"Truncated default strategy that uses kronecker product and union with extra indices\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.TruncatedDefaultPivotCandidateProposer"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#TreeTCI.addglobalpivots!-Union{Tuple{ValueType}, Tuple{TreeTCI.SimpleTCI{ValueType}, Vector{Vector{Int64}}}} where ValueType","page":"API Reference","text":"Add global pivots to IJset.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.addglobalpivots!"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#TreeTCI.edgeInIJkeys-Tuple{NamedGraphs.NamedGraph, Int64, Any}","page":"API Reference","text":"edgeInIJkeys(g::NamedGraph, v::Int, combinededges)\n\nGet the pivots keys for the incoming direction at the vertex from connecting edges.\n\n# Arguments\n- `g::NamedGraph`: The graph to get the index sets for.\n- `v::Int`: The vertex to get the index sets for.\n- `combinededges::Union{NamedEdge,Vector{NamedEdge}}`: The edges to get the index sets for.\n\n# Returns\n- `keys::Vector{SubTreeVertex}`: The pivots keys for the incoming direction at the vertex from connecting edges.\n\n# Example\n```julia\ng = NamedGraph([1, 2, 3, 4])\nadd_edge!(g, 1 => 2)\nadd_edge!(g, 2 => 3)\nadd_edge!(g, 3 => 4)\n@show edgeInIJkeys(g, 2, [2 => 3])\n# [SubTreeVertex([2, 3, 4])]\n@show edgeInIJkeys(g, 2, [1 => 2])\n# [SubTreeVertex([1, 2])]\n```\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.edgeInIJkeys"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#TreeTCI.fillsitetensors-Union{Tuple{ValueType}, Tuple{TreeTCI.SimpleTCI{ValueType}, Any}} where ValueType","page":"API Reference","text":"fillsitetensors(\n    tci::SimpleTCI{ValueType},\n    f;\n    center_vertex::Int = 0,\n) where {ValueType}\n\nFill the site tensors by using a SimpleTCI instance for a tree tensor network.\nCenter vertex is the vertex of the canonical center of the tree tensor network.\n\n# Arguments\n- `tci::SimpleTCI{ValueType}`: The SimpleTCI instance to fill the site tensors for.\n- `f`: The function to use for filling the site tensors.\n\n# Returns\n- `sitetensors::Vector{Pair{Array{ValueType},Vector{NamedEdge}}}`: The site tensors and the edges connecting them to form TensorNetwork by using the SimpleTCI instance.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.fillsitetensors"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#TreeTCI.generate_pivot_candidates-Union{Tuple{ValueType}, Tuple{TreeTCI.DefaultPivotCandidateProposer, TreeTCI.SimpleTCI{ValueType}, NamedGraphs.NamedEdge}} where ValueType","page":"API Reference","text":"Default strategy that runs through within all indices of site tensor according to the bond and connect them with IJSet from neighbors\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.generate_pivot_candidates"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#TreeTCI.generate_sweep2site_path-Union{Tuple{ValueType}, Tuple{TreeTCI.DefaultSweep2sitePathProposer, TreeTCI.SimpleTCI{ValueType}}} where ValueType","page":"API Reference","text":"Default strategy that return the sequence path defined by the edges(g)\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.generate_sweep2site_path"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#TreeTCI.generate_sweep2site_path-Union{Tuple{ValueType}, Tuple{TreeTCI.LocalAdjacentSweep2sitePathProposer, TreeTCI.SimpleTCI{ValueType}}} where ValueType","page":"API Reference","text":"LocalAdjacent strategy that runs through within all indices of site tensor according to the bond and connect them with IJSet from neighbors\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.generate_sweep2site_path"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#TreeTCI.generate_sweep2site_path-Union{Tuple{ValueType}, Tuple{TreeTCI.RandomSweep2sitePathProposer, TreeTCI.SimpleTCI{ValueType}}} where ValueType","page":"API Reference","text":"Random strategy that returns a random sequence of edges\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.generate_sweep2site_path"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#TreeTCI.optimize!-Union{Tuple{ValueType}, Tuple{TreeTCI.SimpleTCI{ValueType}, Any}} where ValueType","page":"API Reference","text":"optimize!(\n    tci::SimpleTCI{ValueType}, f;\n    tolerance::Union{Float64,Nothing} = nothing,\n    maxbonddim::Int = typemax(Int),\n    maxiter::Int = 20,\n    sweepstrategy::AbstractSweep2sitePathProposer = DefaultSweep2sitePathProposer(),\n    pivotstrategy::AbstractPivotCandidateProposer = DefaultPivotCandidateProposer(),\n    verbosity::Int = 0,\n    loginterval::Int = 10,\n    normalizeerror::Bool = true,\n    ncheckhistory::Int = 3,\n)\n\nOptimize the SimpleTCI instance by iteratively updating pivots.\n\nArguments\n\ntci: The SimpleTCI object to optimize\nf: The function to interpolate\ntolerance::Union{Float64,Nothing} = nothing: Error tolerance for convergence\nmaxbonddim::Int = typemax(Int): Maximum bond dimension\nmaxiter::Int = 20: Maximum number of iterations\nsweepstrategy::AbstractSweep2sitePathProposer = DefaultSweep2sitePathProposer(): Strategy for sweeping\npivotstrategy::AbstractPivotCandidateProposer = DefaultPivotCandidateProposer(): Strategy for proposing pivot candidates\nverbosity::Int = 0: Verbosity level\nloginterval::Int = 10: Interval for logging\nnormalizeerror::Bool = true: Whether to normalize errors\nncheckhistory::Int = 3: Number of history steps to check\n\nReturns\n\nranks: Vector of ranks at each iteration\nerrors: Vector of normalized errors at each iteration\n\nNote\n\nThe SimpleTCI object will be modified in place.\nSet tolerance to be > 0 or maxbonddim to some reasonable value. Otherwise, convergence is not reachable.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.optimize!"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#TreeTCI.sweep2site!-Union{Tuple{ValueType}, Tuple{TreeTCI.SimpleTCI{ValueType}, Any, Int64}} where ValueType","page":"API Reference","text":"Perform 2site sweeps on a SimpleTCI.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.sweep2site!"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#TreeTCI.updatepivots!-Union{Tuple{ValueType}, Tuple{F}, Tuple{TreeTCI.SimpleTCI{ValueType}, NamedGraphs.NamedEdge, F}} where {F, ValueType}","page":"API Reference","text":"Update pivots at bond of tci object.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"TreeTCI.updatepivots!"},{"category":"section","location":"#TreeTCI","page":"Home","text":"This is the documentation for TreeTCI.","title":"TreeTCI"}]
